  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard\" style=\"width:22em; font-size:88%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"adr\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"mergedtoprow\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.25em 0.33em 0.33em;line-height:1.2em;font-size:1.25em;\"><span class=\"fn org country-name\">Neptune Commonwealth</span><br /></th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n          <td class=\"maptable\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.5em 0;\"><table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;background:none;\"><tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:58%; vertical-align:middle;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/Neptune_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20170819062414\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Neptune\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/Neptune_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20170819062414\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"66\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neptune Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Neptune_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:auto;vertical-align:middle;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/5e/Neptune_true_colour.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180815090652\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Neptune of Neptune\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/5e/Neptune_true_colour.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/85?cb=20180815090652\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neptune true colour.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Neptune_true_colour.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n              </tr><tr>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Flag</td>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Neptune</td>\n              </tr></tbody></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr><tr>\n         <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.2em;\"><b>Motto:&#160;</b>\"Light in the Darkness\"</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <td class=\"anthem\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.2em;\"><b>Anthem:&#160;</b>\"The Star-Spangled Banner\"</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b></td><td>Aigai</td></tr>\n             <tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n               <th colspan=\"2\">Largest city</th>\n               <td>Chrisjen Bay</td></tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"></th>\n         <td>English (de facto)</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Government</th>\n         <td>United States Planetary Commonwealth</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planetary-Governor_of_Earth\" title=\"Planetary-Governor of Earth\">Planetary-Governor</a></td>\n         <td>Jae Park</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Lieutenant Governor</td>\n         <td>Danny Taslim</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Legislature</th>\n         <td>Planetary Congress</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Upper house\">Upper house</a></td>\n         <td>Planetary Senate</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lower house\">Lower house</a></td>\n         <td>Planetary House of Representatives</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><th colspan=\"3\">Created per Amendemnt to the constitution</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Formation</td>\n         <td>July 4, 2137&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\">Population</th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n            <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">2160&#160;estimate</td>\n            <td>122 Million&#32;(<a href=\"/wiki/List_of_countries_by_population\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of countries by population\">6th</a>)</td>\n          </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">Currency</th>\n           <td>United States dollar ($) (<a href=\"/wiki/ISO_4217\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISO 4217\">USD</a>)</td>\n       </tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Neptune is the eighth planet in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sol_system\" title=\"Sol system\">Sol system</a>. It the sixth most populous <a href=\"/wiki/U.S._planetary_commonwealth\" title=\"U.S. planetary commonwealth\">U.S. planetary commonwealth</a>. 90% of Neptune's population reside on the moon Triton, while the remainder live in mining colonies orbit close to the atmosphere of the planet.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNeptune%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"21st_Century\"><b>21st Century</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNeptune%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Triton\">Triton</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNeptune%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triton is the largest moon beyond the orbit of Saturn and home to 110 million people, 90,000 of which are descended from <a href=\"/wiki/Tel-bn\" title=\"Tel-bn\">Tel-bn</a> brood nannies. Triton was the second moon in the solar system to be tented for paraterraforming after Titan. Paraterraforming is still ongoing and is expected to be completed in the early 23rd century. The import of sunlight from the solar mirror network and locally produced light sources have increased the moon's surface temperature sufficiently to boil off the bulk of all Nitrogen into the growing atmosphere and reduce its ice into a liquid water ocean. Despite these local resources, Triton still imports a sizable amount of raw materials to produce a sustainable atmosphere and ocean.\n</p><p>At 8% Earth's gravity, Triton's population is made predominantly of the <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Lunarian human subspecies</a>, while also sporting the second largest population of Avians beyond Mars. Triton is a regular dumping site for left-over silicates from asteroid mining operations, made in an effort to increase the mass of the Moon and with it its gravity. 55% of Triton's population are in some way involved in the Mining, processing, and export of Helium-3 harvested from Neptune. The rest of the population work in either the Terra-forming industry (11%) or are artisans (14%) and entrepreneurs (20%).\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205641\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 547/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8412/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1130/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 4/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.569      1 Template:Infobox_c